tems around the station.\n\nDual-Wield Freedom: Equip and use weapons in both hands for maximum impact.\n\nStep into Space Station 51 and start your weapon testing adventure today!", "short_description": "You have been assigned to Space Station 51.  Backed by an arsenal of new weapons, you must test them on your Robotic Dummy.  Use  guns, blades and anything you can get your hands on. Test the weapon- get rewarded.  Simulated stress relief is guaranteed!"}]}, "developer_name": "John Ray", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames/space-station-51-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "John Ray Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "ARCADE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7683819988388891"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1219864495695404_4872198366473797799_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZuExHQ03luoQ7kNvwEf3Jb8&_nc_oc=AdosZETfkjpCict4SB_P9WqB3meNyHAjA8pnEvYbFz60G5No4_uiX-2M8o7opHFg_5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE8sp_ZgSeDwFxUWy7bpZgFbac18y4e9YQ2ik-93U4Tuw&oe=6A85A226"}, "is_concep